        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: The AXIS, Planet Hollywood Las Vegas, Las Vegas Strip, Las Vegas, Nevada, United States\n- Organizations: Caesars Entertainment Corporation\n- Events: Miss Universe 2015\n- People: Gloria Diaz, Vic Vargas, Elizabeth Oropesa\n- Topics: sponsorship naming, film casting\n\nFacts:\n- The AXIS, also called The AXIS powered by Monster for sponsorship purposes and the AXIS Theater, is a mid-sized auditorium at Planet Hollywood Las Vegas on the Las Vegas Strip.\n- Planet Hollywood Las Vegas is owned and operated by Caesars Entertainment Corporation.\n- Gloria Diaz held the Miss Universe title in 1969.\n- The film \"Ang Pinakamagandang Hayop sa Balat ng Lupa\" starred Filipino actors Gloria Diaz, Vic Vargas, and Elizabeth Oropesa.\n- Miss Universe 2015, the 64th Miss Universe pageant, was held on 20 December 2015 at The AXIS in Las Vegas, Nevada, United States.",
